This charming studio apartment, located in the attic level of a building, combines the comfort of a cosy living space with the privilege of a private terrace, where you can enjoy moments of relaxation, outdoor dining, or simply take in the views. An ideal opportunity for those seeking a property with character, natural light, and valuable outdoor space.

Features:

- Fully fitted and equipped kitchenette;

- One bathroom;

